EX NO 21: C PROGRAM TO CALCULATE AREA OF TRIANGLE USING POINTER
DATE:30-04-2025


AIM:
To write a program to calculate area of triangle using pointer.

ALGORITHM:
1. Start.
2. Declare three variable value of type float.
3. Prompt the user to enter values.
4. Read the values using scanf.
5. Find the area of triangle using formula
6. End.

PROGRAM:
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
 float base, height, area;
 float *pBase = &base, *pHeight = &height;
 scanf("%f", pBase);
 scanf("%f", pHeight);
 area = 0.5 * (*pBase) * (*pHeight);
 printf("%.2f\n", area);
}


